    existing: { has: ["Bank Islam mobile banking app and the Be U digital banking proposition", "Branch network serving retail and civil-servant financing customers", "Contact centre operating in Bahasa Malaysia and English", "WhatsApp and messaging channels used for customer servicing and notifications"], gaps: ["Restructuring options cannot be offered and concluded conversationally under verifiable Shariah governance", "Financing application status requires human lookup and branch follow-up", "No complete evidence trail that every collections conversation used approved language", "Salary-deduction coordination issues surface late rather than being flagged proactively"] },
    risks: ["Shariah governance requires committee approval of all financing conversation content, offer structures and collections language, with auditability of what was said.", "Bank Negara Malaysia fair-treatment and fair-debt-collection expectations govern conduct, disclosure and AKPK referral obligations.", "Malaysia's Personal Data Protection Act 2010 governs consent for outbound contact and the retention of voice and messaging records, including employer-linked payroll data."],
