    pilotScope: "A Bahasa Malaysia and English personal-financing reminder agent on voice and WhatsApp using only Shariah-committee-approved language and offer structures, integrated to financing servicing and payment rails, measured on reminder coverage, on-time payment rate and Shariah-conformance scoring across all conversations.",
