    discovery: ["How many routine queries reach relationship managers directly each month, and what does that displace in business development?", "What share of SME contacts arrive outside contact-centre operating hours?", "Can business banking core systems expose balances, transaction status and financing progress through APIs?", "Which SME questions must always route to a human because they touch credit appetite or pricing?"],
